Add ONE line to your globals.css, immediately after the tailwind import:

    @import "tailwindcss";
    @import "../styles/jhai-theme-base.css";

Adjust the relative path to wherever the file landed. To rebrand, append a :root block AFTER that import overriding only --jh-* values — see the CLIENT REBRAND block at the foot of the file. Do not edit any --ink-*, --paper-*, --bjarmi-* or shadcn semantic token directly: they resolve through --jh-* and editing them breaks the chain.
